  "bodyHash": "b8b1c8ad3c8b077e",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/8r1dlX6.png\" alt=\"模组横幅\" width=\"782\" height=\"89\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>⚠️&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>此为官方同人作品，未获得 CD PROJEKT RED 的批准或认可。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>⚙️ 前置要求</h2>\n<p>本模组需要以下前置库：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AZURE LIB 1.0.11+</strong></a></li>\n<li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smartbrainlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>SMART BRAIN LIB 1.9+</strong></a></li>\n<li>✅ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bjornlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>BJORNLIB 1.0.11+</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>⚠️ <strong>更新模组时，请务必删除您的 <code>config</code> 文件夹。</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>💬 加入社区</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/upfvBpYSD3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/023/741/066/non_2x/discord-logo-icon-social-media-icon-free-png.png\" alt=\"Discord 图标\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>🧙 成为猎魔人、术士、古老血脉持有者等</h2>\n<p>本模组允许你成为<strong>猎魔人、术士及其他职业</strong>，并在世界各地接受<strong>狩猎委托</strong>。使用强大的<strong>法印</strong>，<strong>提升等级</strong>，并<strong>强化你的装备</strong>。</p>\n<p>高度可配置：你可以创建自己的委托、添加配方，并定义生物类型（例如<strong>诅咒类</strong>、<strong>野兽类</strong>、<strong>食腐类</strong>等），使其非常适合怪物狩猎整合包。</p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>✋ 猎魔人法印</h2>\n<p>你可以使用全部五种猎魔人法印：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🔄 按下 <code>G</code> 键切换法印。</li>\n<li>🪄 按下 <code>R</code> 键释放当前选中的法印。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>可用法印：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>🔵 <strong>亚克西 (Aard)</strong>：将面前的敌人击退。</li>\n<li>🔥 <strong>伊格尼 (Igni)</strong>：发射一道造成火焰伤害的光束。</li>\n<li>🧠 <strong>阿尔德 (Axii)</strong>：使敌人陷入眩晕。较聪明的敌人可能会暂时为你而战。</li>\n<li>🌀 <strong>伊尔丹 (Yrden)</strong>：布置魔法陷阱，对幽灵类怪物造成额外伤害。</li>\n<li>🛡️ <strong>昆恩 (Quen)</strong>：生成护盾，抵挡下一次受到的攻击。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所有法印均可通过解锁新能力进行升级。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1240/834/imagen_2025-07-03_211731655-png.png\" alt=\"imagen_2025-07-03_211731655.png\" width=\"367\" height=\"226\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1240/835/imagen_2025-07-03_211948189-png.png\" alt=\"item image\" width=\"243\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>术士法术</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1240/837/imagen_2025-07-03_212445655-png.png\" alt=\"imagen_2025-07-03_212445655.png\" width=\"308\" height=\"220\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/440229/description_30d57214-e289-42a3-9d15-8d3b04005f08.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"220\"></p>\n<p>这仅是部分展示，所有职业还有更多法术可供学习。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>🧠 技能</h2>\n<p>随着等级提升，按下 <code>U</code> 键解锁并装备独特的猎魔人技能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/617/293/2023-02-05_11.png\" alt=\"技能界面\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>⚗️ 炼金术</h2>\n<p>按下 <code>K</code> 键打开炼金菜单，制作各种实用的猎魔人道具。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>灵感源自《巫师3》中的炼金系统。</li>\n<li>支持完全自定义配置：可添加新配方、分类和物品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/617/288/2023-02-04_13.png\" alt=\"炼金菜单\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>🐎 呼唤系统</h2>\n<p>驯服马匹（或任何坐骑）并保存后，你可以在任何地点将其召唤而来&mdash;&mdash;即使死亡后也能做到。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🔘 骑乘时按下 <code>H</code> 键保存坐骑。</li>\n<li>📯 按下 <code>J</code> 键将其召唤。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>📝 适用于所有坐骑，不仅限于马匹。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>🎯 玩家概率机制</h2>\n<p>为玩家战斗增添额外的 RPG 风格概率判定：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>💥 暴击率</li>\n<li>🛡️ 闪避率</li>\n<li>☠️ 中毒率</li>\n<li>🩸 流血率</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/617/300/2023-02-05_11.png\" alt=\"战斗属性\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>🛢️ 淬炼油</h2>\n<p>淬炼油可涂抹在<strong>银剑</strong>上，以针对特定类型的怪物提升伤害。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>手持淬炼油右键点击武器即可涂抹。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1240/839/imagen_2025-07-03_213622351-png.png\" alt=\"item image\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>⚔️ 银剑与钢剑</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>银剑</strong>：对怪物造成更高伤害。</li>\n<li><strong>钢剑</strong>：对人类造成更高伤害。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>⚙️ 其他机制</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🔥 怪物在白天不再燃烧。</li>\n<li>🪵 右键点击营火可设置重生点。</li>\n<li>⚔️ 右键点击砥石可获得临时暴击加成。</li>\n<li>🕴️ 跳跃暴击已被基于概率的暴击系统取代。</li>\n<li>🛡️ 盔甲会根据重量减缓玩家移动速度。</li>\n<li>🧟&zwj;♂️ 本模组还为世界增添了新怪物、令人畏惧的首领、动态事件以及众多其他沉浸式功能。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>🧩 内置兼容模组</h2>\n<p>以下模组已提供开箱即用的兼容性支持（例如任务系统、武器/淬炼油支持）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Whisperwoods</li>\n<li>Meetyourfight</li>\n<li>Biomemakeover</li>\n<li>Alex&rsquo;s Mobs</li>\n<li>Creeper Overhaul</li>\n<li>Weird Mobs</li>\n<li>Savage &amp; Ravage</li>\n<li>Friends and Foes</li>\n<li>Hunter Illager</li>\n<li>Monster Plus</li>\n<li>Better Combat</li>\n<li>MCA Reborn</li>\n<li>Obscure Tooltips</li>\n<li>Alex Caves</li>\n<li>Colossal Giants</li>\n<li>Enderman Overhaul</li>\n<li>Enemy Expansion</li>\n<li>Illager Invasion</li>\n<li>Orcz</li>\n<li>Raided</li>\n<li>Rats</li>\n<li>Realm RPG: Imps &amp; Demons</li>\n<li>Realm RPG: Dragon Wyrms</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></h2>\n<h2>⚠️ Alpha 测试状态</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>🚧 <strong>本模组目前处于 Alpha（早期测试）阶段。</strong></p>\n<p>🧨 可能会出现崩溃或其他模组的兼容性问题。</p>\n<p>🐞 如果遇到 Bug，请在反馈区提交报告。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f464159c-1ee2-48bf-91b5-a1f406628200.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">我的其他模组&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-witcher-world-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1238/873/638810960517569231.png\" alt=\"猎魔人世界\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pirates-treasures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1031/133/638553772546353962.png\" alt=\"海盗与宝藏\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalcraft-skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1060/665/638592491337254994.png\" alt=\"VitalCraft：技能树\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalcraft-runes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1075/81/638612119101538942.png\" alt=\"VitalCraft：符文\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy-dragon-breaths\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1321/883/638859416236963261.png\" alt=\"龙骑Legacy：龙息\" width=\"129\" height=\"129\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-chimneys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1154/933/638722416788508737.png\" alt=\"Create：烟囱\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-remastered-more-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_f9c9d0fe-6f33-43fd-aab5-a7c630a57aea.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-more-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1154/935/638722417025475522.jpeg\" alt=\"龙骑：更多龙\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987226/description_ac376303-3148-4c79-8aed-7571077c0017.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>",
